# On top of karotz-6.1-debug.config, for qemu-mini2440/real-usr.sh: the
# Karotz's own NAND driver on QEMU's model of its chip (256 MiB of 512-byte
# pages, id 71, MINI2440_NAND_CID=0x71) holding a real Karotz's flash, in
# place of nandsim. The debug config left the driver out because QEMU's
# default chip was not one 6.1 identifies.
CONFIG_MTD_NAND_S3C2410=y
# CONFIG_MTD_NAND_NANDSIM is not set
